{"id":"uso","lemma":"uso","pos":"noun","rank":1112,"glosses":["use","usage; habit","wear (degradation)"],"ipa":"/ˈuso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"usos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-uso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Uso lentes de contacto.","en":"I wear contact lenses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453834"},{"text":"Esta sartén tiene muchos usos.","en":"This pan has several uses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551879"},{"text":"Lo uso todos los días.","en":"I use it every day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34867"},{"text":"Usos y costumbres varían mucho de un país a otro.","en":"Manners and customs vary greatly from country to country.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803703"},{"text":"Esto es para uso interno.","en":"This is for internal use.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523139"}]}